{
  "id": "1149",
  "title": "Couple Resemblance",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2020-12-12",
  "synopsis": "Have you ever wondered why couples tend to look alike?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1149/ee6adf9b707ef6dc2b33004c37d76d9bf26855c2.mp3?1605256800",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "夫妻相\n\n小乐：哇，你看对面那对夫妻，长得好有夫妻相啊！\n保罗：什么是夫妻相？\n小乐：夫妻相就是夫妻在一起生活时间长了。吃的是一样的，喝的也是一样的。两个人住在一起，慢慢地，两个人就长得很像了。\n保罗：怪不得我的妈妈没有以前好看了，原来是和我爸爸有夫妻相了。",
    "traditional": "夫妻相\n\n小樂：哇，你看對面那對夫妻，長得好有夫妻相啊！\n保羅：什麼是夫妻相？\n小樂：夫妻相就是夫妻在一起生活時間長了。吃的是一樣的，喝的也是一樣的。兩個人住在一起，慢慢地，兩個人就長得很像了。\n保羅：怪不得我的媽媽沒有以前好看了，原來是和我爸爸有夫妻相了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Couples Tend to Look Alike"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：哇，你看对面那对夫妻，长得好有夫妻相啊！",
      "traditional": "小樂：哇，你看對面那對夫妻，長得好有夫妻相啊！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè wā nǐ kàn duì miàn nà duì fū qī zhǎng de hǎo yǒu fū qī xiàng a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Wow, look at that couple opposite. They really have “couple resemblance”."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：什么是夫妻相？",
      "traditional": "保羅：什麼是夫妻相？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó shén me shì fū qī xiàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: What is “couple resemblance”?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐：夫妻相就是夫妻在一起生活时间长了。",
      "traditional": "小樂：夫妻相就是夫妻在一起生活時間長了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè fū qī xiàng jiù shì fū qī zài yì qǐ shēng huó shí jiān cháng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "吃的是一样的，喝的也是一样的。",
      "traditional": "吃的是一樣的，喝的也是一樣的。",
      "pinyin": "chī de shì yí yàng de hē de yě shì yí yàng de",
      "english": "Little Le: “Couple resemblance” happens when a couple has been together for a long time."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "两个人住在一起，慢慢地，两个人就长得很像了。",
      "traditional": "兩個人住在一起，慢慢地，兩個人就長得很像了。",
      "pinyin": "liǎng ge rén zhù zài yì qǐ màn man de liǎng ge rén jiù zhǎng de hěn xiàng le",
      "english": "What they eat is the same, and what they drink is also the same."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "When two people live together, they will slowly grow to resemble each other."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "保罗：怪不得我的妈妈没有以前好看了，原来是和我爸爸有夫妻相了。",
      "traditional": "保羅：怪不得我的媽媽沒有以前好看了，原來是和我爸爸有夫妻相了。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó guài bu de wǒ de mā ma méi yǒu yǐ qián hǎo kàn le yuán lái shì hé wǒ bà ba yǒu fū qī xiàng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: No wonder my mom isn’t as good-looking as before. It turns out that she and my dad have “couple resemblance”."
    }
  ],
